5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's be thorough. To ensure we maintain a healthy portfolio and a sustainable reporting process, I'd like to start by examining the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with the need for thoroughness. I would like to look into the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful to see such diligence from everyone. I believe it would be wise to look into the account retention through price rises and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll focus on the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line. It's important to understand our financial flexibility before committing further capital.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Since we've covered the financials and staffing, I'll focus on the operational friction. I want to see the security review time before first deployment and the profile of the exits and the write-off.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
