11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It is a balanced approach that respects the different dimensions of risk and potential. I am content to proceed with these selections.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree as well. It feels very harmonious to have each of us looking into something different. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. There is no need for further overlap. Let's proceed with these choices and see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
