62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Ledger Bridge does seem like a gentle choice. It avoids the physical struggles of sensors or clothing, and it feels much simpler than medical software. It would be lovely to have something so uncomplicated.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
