64,3,1,talk,Shion,,Ledger Bridge is the only logical choice. It avoids the medical data bottlenecks of Clinic Scheduler and the physical overhead of the others. It's the only one that won't get stuck in a nine-month review.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,The consensus is absolute. Ledger Bridge aligns with every constraint we've identified: it avoids the audit delays of physical assets and the regulatory friction of medical data. It is the only choice that protects our reporting cycle.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
